{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CO","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"哥林多前书","commonName":"哥林多前书","title":"哥林多前书","order":46,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"3ea536a95e4975b8ebe77976cde16baab162baac7648d81845fd421e8b0ad812","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":437},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["祭偶像的食物"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["关于祭过偶像的食物，我们知道大家都有这方面的知识，但知识会使人自高，唯有爱心才能造就人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["若有人自以为知道些什么，其实他仍未达到真正知道的地步。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["但如果有人爱上帝，这人是上帝所认识的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["关于吃祭过偶像的食物，我们知道世上的偶像算不得什么，只有一位上帝，此外别无他神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["虽然天上地上有许多被称为神明的，好像有许多神明、许多主，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但我们只有一位上帝，就是天父，祂是万物的源头，是我们的归宿。我们也只有一位主，就是耶稣基督，万物都是借着祂而存在，我们也是借着祂而存在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["不过，并不是所有的人都有这种知识。有些人因为以前拜惯了偶像，现在吃到某些食物就觉得是祭过偶像的，良心因为不安而被玷污了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["其实食物并不能使我们讨上帝喜悦，我们不吃也没有损失，吃了也不会更好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但你们要小心，不要让你们的自由绊倒那些软弱的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["如果有人看见你这明白以上道理的人竟然坐在偶像的庙中吃喝，他虽然良心不安，岂不还是会放胆吃祭过偶像的食物吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["这样，你的知识反而令那软弱的，就是基督舍命救回的弟兄姊妹受损。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你们这样得罪弟兄姊妹，伤了他们脆弱的良心，就是得罪基督。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所以，如果我吃某些食物会让我的弟兄在信仰上跌倒，我就情愿永远不吃",{"noteId":10},"，免得令他们跌倒。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"“不吃”希腊文是“不吃肉”。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CO/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}